Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: blueberry-pie-os-init
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Depends: libbsm, libsystem
Description: the init process (/sbin/launchd)
 init.c, a small init that is also the bootstrap server, installed as
 /sbin/launchd. It runs /etc/rc, then keeps getty on the console.
 It falls back to a root shell if getty or login is unavailable.
